  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/WeS8L88.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"982\" height=\"197\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"http://www.minecraftforum.net/forums/mapping-and-modding/minecraft-mods/2755185\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 论坛</a> - <a href=\"https://github.com/MattCzyr/NaturesCompass\" rel=\"nofollow\">源代码</a>&nbsp;- <a href=\"https://github.com/MattCzyr/NaturesCompass/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">问题追踪器</a></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>自然罗盘是一款实用道具，允许您在世界中任何地方搜索生物群系的位置并查看相关信息。如果您正在寻找定位结构的指南针，请查看<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/explorers-compass\" rel=\"nofollow\">探险家罗盘</a>。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>功能</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>手持自然罗盘右键点击将打开生物群系选择界面，您可以在其中搜索生物群系或查看其信息</li>\n<li>按住 Shift 键右键点击将重置罗盘状态</li>\n<li>当罗盘未指向任何生物群系时，它将指向世界出生点</li>\n<li>兼容所有生物群系（原版与模组添加）</li>\n<li>黑名单生物群系和最大搜索距离等设置可在配置文件中调整</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>截图</strong></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/rhz4gLR.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"965\" height=\"543\"></p>\n<p><em>找到的生物群系信息将显示在 HUD 上</em></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/GTSAfqv.png\" width=\"965\" height=\"543\"></p>\n<p><em>生物群系选择界面</em></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/vjsdZZ4.png\" width=\"965\" height=\"543\"></p>\n<p><em>生物群系信息界面</em></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>合成配方</strong></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/175k4oE.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"495\" height=\"246\"></p>\n<p><em>树苗和原木使用矿物词典。</em></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>整合包</strong></span></p>\n<p>是的，您可以将此模组用于您的整合包中。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>支持</strong></span></p>\n<p>如果您喜欢这个模组并希望支持该项目，欢迎通过 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.paypal.com%252fcgi-bin%252fwebscr%253freturn%253dhttps%253a%252f%252fwww.curseforge.com%252fprojects%252f256087%2526cn%253dAdd%2bspecial%2binstructions%2bto%2bthe%2baddon%2bauthor()%2526business%253dmattczyr%2540gmail.com%2526bn%253dPP-DonationsBF%253abtn_donateCC_LG.gif%253aNonHosted%2526cancel_return%253dhttps%253a%252f%252fwww.curseforge.com%252fprojects%252f256087%2526lc%253dUS%2526item_name%253dNotes%2b(from%2bcurseforge.com)%2526cmd%253d_donations%2526rm%253d1%2526no_shipping%253d1%2526currency_code%253dUSD\" rel=\"nofollow\">PayPal 捐赠</a>。非常感谢您的支持！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>赞助</strong></span></p>\n<p>本项目由 BisectHosting 赞助。如果您正在寻找服务器托管服务，<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fchaos\" rel=\"nofollow\">请查看他们的托管方案</a>，并在结账时使用优惠码 <em>Chaos</em> 享受首月 25% 的折扣！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fchaos\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/0998de1c-6d3e-4370-a553-0da42e986c68.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1086\" height=\"180\"></a></p>",
